@startuml
actor User
rectangle GeoDiary
cloud "Google OAuth" as Google
cloud Mapbox
cloud "MongoDB Atlas" as Mongo
cloud "Image storage" as Images
User --> GeoDiary : private diary UI
GeoDiary --> Google : authenticate
GeoDiary --> Mongo : profiles, sessions, diaries
GeoDiary --> Images : image bytes
GeoDiary --> Mapbox : map resources
User --> Mapbox : browser tiles
@enduml
